catflow 0.8
1. Template            "Write the launch announcement for AcmeSync 2.0:
                       calendar sync for small teams, ships Aug 1, $6/seat"
2. Draft               Qwen3 8B; "Write the launch announcement"
3. Template            "{1}"
4. Critique            Ministral 3B; "accurate, concise, friendly"
5. Gate        (3,4)   Ministral 3B; "Real weaknesses left? tags: fix,
                       ship"; max_visits=3; on_budget=ship
   -> { fix: 6 | ship: 7 }
6. Revise      (3,4)   Qwen3 8B
   -> 3
7. Save Text   (3)     announcement.md
